# secrets/backup_ssh/config – SSH-Zugang zur SFTP-Backup-Speicher (Port 23, nur Schlüssel)
Host storagebox
    HostName backup.example.net
    User uXXXXXX
    Port 23
    IdentityFile /root/.ssh/id_ed25519
    IdentitiesOnly yes
    StrictHostKeyChecking yes
    UserKnownHostsFile /root/.ssh/known_hosts
